{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56683","headline":"纪弥勒菩萨上生变赞 · 无名氏","name":"纪弥勒菩萨上生变赞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上越参罗第四天，三柢道满实难宣。\n补□慈尊光□□，谁蒙□圣□三千。\n宝树常能说妙然，八功池内锁门莲，铁纲玲珑严宝柱，无住竞奏□诸天。\n盈盈玉女凭珠槛，两两玉童弄绿波。\n报□□分随器变，修因六行更无过。\n（见《山右石刻丛编》卷八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}